// Absorb Spirit Sphere (MO_ABSORBSPIRITS): the reference EF 253 stands two tall
// faint blue ring_blue columns and a flared base around the caster for ~1.5s
// while blue sparks rise through them. Columns are rings of trapezoid
// billboards; a blue glow gathers at the chest. ~1.5s.
// Coordinates follow inc_agi.strfx.ron: (319, 291) is the unit's feet, smaller
// y is higher, 1024 angle units per turn. The body spans about y 191..291.
